I will create a new dashboard showing revenue by region and month along with a units KPI from your Retail orders dataset. Since no specific dataset, visual, or dashboard is currently open, numeric details are not available yet. Please open one to see specific figures.

@@ACTION {"kind":"dashboard","intent":"revenue by region and month with a units KPI"}
---
{
  "name": "Revenue and Units Analysis",
  "rationale": "This plan provides a comprehensive view of revenue across time and geographic territories, complemented by high-level unit volume tracking. Evaluating regional monthly trends reveals seasonal performance variations across markets.",
  "calculatedFields": [],
  "sheets": [
    {
      "name": "Revenue by Region and Month",
      "metrics": [
        {
          "dataset": "Retail orders",
          "column": "units",
          "aggregation": "sum",
          "label": "Total Units"
        }
      ],
      "visuals": [
        {
          "dataset": "Retail orders",
          "name": "Revenue by Region and Month",
          "chartType": "stacked_column",
          "encoding": {
            "category": "Month",
            "values": [
              {
                "column": "revenue",
                "aggregation": "sum"
              }
            ],
            "series": "region"
          },
          "filters": []
        },
        {
          "visual": "Revenue by month"
        },
        {
          "dataset": "Retail orders",
          "name": "Revenue by Region",
          "chartType": "bar",
          "encoding": {
            "category": "region",
            "values": [
              {
                "column": "revenue",
                "aggregation": "sum"
              }
            ]
          },
          "filters": []
        }
      ],
      "texts": [
        {
          "heading": "Overview",
          "text": "Explore overall sales performance by region and monthly progression alongside total unit volume."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
